    <string name="settings_privacy_lead">Nothing is tracked. No account, no analytics, no ads.</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_tracks">Your tours and routes stay on your phone and in your own backup folder. When you pair your phone with your browser, your saved routes and imported tracks are sent there so you can plan on your computer too. They are encrypted on the phone first: only your phone and your browser can read them – we can't. Recorded tours are never sent.</string>
